{"id": "5345", "type": "post", "slug": "mushroom-nut-pate-vegan", "path": "mushroom-nut-pate-vegan", "title": "Mushroom Nut Pâté (Vegan)", "date": "2017-07-26 00:00:00", "modified": "2025-05-30 16:11:30", "excerpt": "We found out what your veggie wrap was missing. It's this pâté. Luckily, we have the recipe for you...", "content": "\n            <p>We found out what your veggie wrap was missing. It's this&nbsp;pâté. Luckily, we have the recipe for you... so there is no need to miss out again!</p>\n\n<p><em>Quick Tip: </em>Salads or veggie wraps alone not filling you up? Adding satiating flavor of mushrooms along with seeds and nuts containing healthy fats help&nbsp;to transform just a salad into a hearty meal.</p>\n\n<p><strong>INGREDIENTS </strong></p>\n\n<p>2 portobello&nbsp;mushrooms</p>\n<p>1/2 C. almonds</p>\n<p>1/4 C. walnuts</p>\n<p>1/2 C. sunflower seeds</p>\n<p>1/2 onion</p>\n<p>1 sweet red pepper</p>\n<p>1 carrot</p>\n<p>1/4 bunch cilantro</p>\n<p>1/2 tsp. cumin powder</p>\n<p>1/2 tsp. allspice powder</p>\n<p>1/4 tsp. turmeric powder</p>\n<p>1/2 tsp. curry powder</p>\n<p>2 garlic cloves</p>\n<p>1 T. pizza spice</p>\n<p>1 T. Bragg’s Liquid Aminos</p>\n<p>1/2 tsp. lemon juice</p>\n<p>1/2 tsp. thyme</p>\n<p>3 T. olive oil</p>\n\n<p><strong>DIRECTIONS</strong></p>\n\n<p>Combine all ingredients in a food processor, blending the nuts to form a paste. Refrigerate until ready to serve.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This recipe is courtesy of Zainab Fisher, a professional chef who specializes in raw and vegan cuisine. She has served as the chef at The Raw Kitchen and as a guest chef for FOX29 WFLXD and the CBS 12, Heath and Wellness Expo.</p>\n\n<p>For more information on Chef Zainab’s culinary services: <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection\" class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"8df7ece4e3ecefcdf7e8e1e4eee4e2f8feeef8e4fee4e3e8a3eee2e0\">[email&nbsp;protected]</a></p>\n        ", "seoTitle": null, "seoDesc": null, "canonical": null, "ogTitle": null, "ogDesc": null, "image": null, "terms": {"category": [{"name": "Archive", "slug": "archive"}]}, "elementor": false, "content_live": "<div data-elementor-type=\"single-post\" data-elementor-id=\"4107\" class=\"elementor elementor-4107 elementor-location-single post-7343 meal-plans-recipe type-meal-plans-recipe status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry recipes-tag-party-dish recipes-tag-side-dish\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-3b33007 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"3b33007\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b91ac1b\" data-id=\"b91ac1b\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-183d933 elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"183d933\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><a href=\"\">Home / </a></h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ace4981 elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ace4981\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><a href=\"/learning-centre/\"> Online Learning / </a></h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-65b151a elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"65b151a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"><a href=\"/learning-centre/meal-plans-recipes/\">Meal Plans &amp; Recipes</a></h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-df4ba5a elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"df4ba5a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">/ Mushroom Nut Pâté (Vegan)</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c8441aa elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"c8441aa\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f11e88d\" data-id=\"f11e88d\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8ba3d8a elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-title elementor-page-title elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"8ba3d8a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-title.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Mushroom Nut Pâté (Vegan)</h1>\t\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-e36fb25 elementor-reverse-tablet elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"e36fb25\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3fa6ad9\" data-id=\"3fa6ad9\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1656899 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-featured-image elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"1656899\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-featured-image.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<img fetchpriority=\"high\" width=\"1080\" height=\"608\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/mushroom-nut-pa-te-vegan-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-7363\" alt=\"Mushroom Nut Pâté (Vegan)\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b9a90d1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content\" data-id=\"b9a90d1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"theme-post-content.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"mb-50\">\n<h2 class=\"h3 strong\">Ingredients</h2>\n<ul class=\"ingredients\">\n<li>2 portobello mushrooms</li>\n<li>1/2 C. almonds</li>\n<li>1/4 C. walnuts</li>\n<li>1/2 C. sunflower seeds</li>\n<li>1/2 onion</li>\n<li>1 sweet red pepper</li>\n<li>1 carrot</li>\n<li>1/4 bunch cilantro</li>\n<li>1/2 tsp. cumin powder</li>\n<li>1/2 tsp. allspice powder</li>\n<li>1/4 tsp. turmeric powder</li>\n<li>1/2 tsp. curry powder</li>\n<li>2 garlic cloves</li>\n<li>1 T. pizza spice</li>\n<li>1 T. Bragg’s Liquid Aminos</li>\n<li>1/2 tsp. lemon juice</li>\n<li>1/2 tsp. thyme</li>\n<li>3 T. olive oil</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"my-50\">\n<h3 class=\"strong\">Method</h3>\n<ol class=\"method\">\n<li>Combine all ingredients in a food processor, blending the nuts to form a paste.</li>\n<li>Refrigerate until ready to serve.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-62bffe3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"62bffe3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0095edb elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0095edb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<p>Share article:</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-321852a elementor-share-buttons--skin-minimal elementor-share-buttons--align-left elementor-share-buttons--color-custom elementor-share-buttons--view-icon elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-share-buttons--shape-square elementor-grid-0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-share-buttons\" data-id=\"321852a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"share-buttons.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<div class=\"elementor-grid\" role=\"list\">\n<div class=\"elementor-grid-item\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"elementor-share-btn elementor-share-btn_facebook\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Share on facebook\">\n<span class=\"elementor-share-btn__icon\">\n<svg class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fab-facebook\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504 256C504 119 393 8 256 8S8 119 8 256c0 123.78 90.69 226.38 209.25 245V327.69h-63V256h63v-54.64c0-62.15 37-96.48 93.67-96.48 27.14 0 55.52 4.84 55.52 4.84v61h-31.28c-30.8 0-40.41 19.12-40.41 38.73V256h68.78l-11 71.69h-57.78V501C413.31 482.38 5