small\">Directions to make our Raw Broccoli Better-Than-Cheddar Soup. It is possible to heat food and still keep it raw, just remember 115 Degrees is your top temperature.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card-footer\">\n<a href=\"/raw-broccoli-better-than-cheddar-soup/\" class=\"btn btn-text\" aria-label=\"Go to Raw Broccoli Better-Than-Cheddar Soup\" tabindex=\"0\">View recipe</a>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"card bg-white text-secondary\">\n<a href=\"/mushroom-stuffed-with-creamed-spinach/\" class=\"card-image\" tabindex=\"0\">\n<div class=\"ratio-3by2\">\n<img alt=\"Mushroom Stuffed with Creamed Spinach\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/stuffed_mushroom_pic_by_andre-s_jime-nez_0036-1024x683-2.jpg\">\n</div>\n</a>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<a href=\"/mushroom-stuffed-with-creamed-spinach/\" class=\"h5\" tabindex=\"0\">Mushroom Stuffed with Creamed Spinach</a>\n<div class=\"card-date text-muted secondary-font strong\">\n<span>Appetizer, Party Dish</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"small\">Filling, rich, creamy, and fully raw vegan. Enjoy our recipe for these sumptuous mushrooms as is, or warm right out of your dehydrator.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card-footer\">\n<a href=\"/mushroom-stuffed-with-creamed-spinach/\" class=\"btn btn-text\" aria-label=\"Go to Mushroom Stuffed with Creamed Spinach\" tabindex=\"0\">View recipe</a>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-23c71f9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"23c71f9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/slick-carousel@1.8.1/slick/slick.css\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/slick-carousel@1.8.1/slick/slick-theme.css\">\n<style>\n.slick-dots button {\nwidth: 20px !important;\nheight: 20px !important;\nborder: 1px solid #000 !important;\n}\n.slick-dots button:focus, .slick-dot